{
 "en": [
  {
   "title": "Overview",
   "icon": "automaticspawner:chaos_spawner",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "AutomaticSpawner is a virtual mob farm in one block. Mobs killed by a player drop their souls. Put the souls into a Chaos Spawner and every cycle it \"kills\" those mobs virtually: nothing spawns in the world, you get their real loot table drops and the experience is stored."
    },
    {
     "text": "Any mob works, including mobs from other mods."
    },
    {
     "items": [
      "automaticspawner:chaos_spawner",
      "automaticspawner:mob_soul"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Mob souls",
   "icon": "automaticspawner:mob_soul",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "Any mob can drop its soul when a player kills it, with any weapon, a bow or even bare hands."
    },
    {
     "table": [
      [
       "No enchantment",
       "2.5% (≈1 in 40)"
      ],
      [
       "Looting I",
       "3.5%"
      ],
      [
       "Looting II",
       "4.5%"
      ],
      [
       "Looting III",
       "5.5% (≈1 in 18)"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The Ender Dragon never drops a soul. Chances and the blacklist are set in automaticspawner-server.toml (the world's serverconfig folder)."
    },
    {
     "text": "With EMI, the Soul Drops tab shows what every soul drops and how often."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Chaos Spawner",
   "icon": "automaticspawner:chaos_spawner",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "table": [
